---
profile: basic
skip_list:
  - yaml
  # This project uses a documented xs_*/proxmox_* naming scheme that is shared
  # across roles and is part of the public interface. no-role-prefix wants every
  # variable renamed to <role_name>_*, which would rename all of it. The rest of
  # var-naming still applies.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
